flowchart LR
    Evidence[Public and authorized evidence] --> Registry[Threat registry]
    Analyst[Threat analyst] --> Registry
    Registry --> Compiler[Scenario compiler]
    Compiler --> Range[Adaptive assurance range]
    Range --> Champion[Champion controls]
    Range --> Challenger[Challenger controls]
    Champion --> Evaluator[Independent evaluator]
    Challenger --> Evaluator
    Evaluator --> Report[Promotion or rejection report]
    Reviewer[Human reviewer] --> Report
    Report --> Decision{Approve change?}
    Decision -->|No| Backlog[Research backlog]
    Decision -->|Yes| Export[Governed model or policy export]

